error[B0201]: expected `String`, found `Bool`
  --> check/key_paths.bloom:11:32
   |
11 |   next[keyPath: \Prefs.name] = true
   |                                ^^^^ this is `Bool`
   |
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0403]: cannot assign to `p`: it is immutable
  --> check/key_paths.bloom:16:3
   |
15 | public func immutable(_ p: Prefs, _ key: WritableKeyPath<Prefs, Bool>) -> Bool {
   |                         - declared here
16 |   p[keyPath: key] = false
   |   ^ immutable
   |
help: copy it into a `var`: `var next = p`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

error[B0403]: cannot assign through `KeyPath<Prefs, Bool>`: it is read-only
  --> check/key_paths.bloom:22:17
   |
22 |   next[keyPath: key] = true
   |                 ^^^ a `KeyPath` reads; a `WritableKeyPath` writes
   |
help: take a `WritableKeyPath<Prefs, Bool>`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

error[B0403]: cannot assign through `KeyPath<Prefs, Int>`: it is read-only
  --> check/key_paths.bloom:28:17
   |
28 |   next[keyPath: \Prefs.id] = 3
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^ `id` is a `let`
   |
help: declare it `var id`; a `let` is set once, when the struct is made
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

error[B0403]: cannot assign to `id`: it is a `let`
  --> check/key_paths.bloom:29:3
   |
29 |   next.id = 4
   |   ^^^^^^^ a `let` of `Prefs`, set once when it is made
   |
help: declare it `var id`, or make a new `Prefs` with the value
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#44-structs

